    <h2>No Attorney-Client Relationship</h2>
    <p>No reader, user, or browser of this site should act or refrain from acting on the basis of information on this site without first seeking legal or tax advice from counsel in the relevant jurisdiction. Only your individual attorney or tax professional can provide assurances that the information contained herein – and your interpretation of it – is applicable or appropriate to your particular situation. Use of, and access to, this website or any of the links or resources contained within the site do not create an attorney-client or advisory-client relationship between the reader, user, or browser and Dubai US Capital.</p>

